<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Data.KnowledgeBase.Web</RootNamespace>
    <TargetFrameworks>net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <AssemblyName>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Web.KnowledgeBase</AssemblyName>
    <Platforms>AnyCPU;x64</Platforms>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;LipidSearch;mzkit;NPSearch;Rsharp_app_release;nuget_release</Configurations>
    <Version>1.0.9762.10518</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.0.9762.10518</AssemblyVersion>
    <Title>Microsoft Bing Web, Academic, Translation and DOI Services Client</Title>
    <Description>Bing service clients for sciBASIC# knowledge base enrichment: scrape web search results with paging, query the academic search portal for article profiles and citations, look up word translations, and decode DOI handle service responses.</Description>
    <AssemblyTitle>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Data.KnowledgeBase.Web</AssemblyTitle>
    <Authors>xieguigang &lt;I@xieguigang.me&gt;</Authors>
    <Company>sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Company>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Copyright>
    <PackageTags>scibasic;bing;search-engine;web-scraping;academic-search;translation;doi;knowledge-base</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>The Microsoft Bing (and DOI) service clients of sciBASIC#, used for knowledge base enrichment. Web search: SearchEngineProvider builds Bing query URLs, downloads and parses result pages into WebResult items (title, URL, brief text, update date) and supports paging through NextPage / HaveNext together with an all-results iterator. Academic search: the Bing.Academic namespace performs term search returning candidate article links, scrapes article profiles into ArticleProfile metadata (authors, journal, DOI, citations, keywords), and provides Extensions that build a literature knowledge base from a term and summarize article sets. Translation: Bing.Translation looks up a word and returns its pronunciation plus a list of target words through WordTranslation. DOI: the DOI namespace provides a strongly typed response model for the DOI handle service (handle, values, HS_ADMIN). Together these clients let a sciBASIC# knowledge base pipeline discover literature, resolve identifiers and translate terminology without hand written scraping code.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>GPL-3.0-or-later</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageIcon>logo-knot.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageProjectUrl>http://scibasic.net/</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/xieguigang/sciBASIC</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|AnyCPU'">
    <DocumentationFile>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Web.KnowledgeBase.xml</DocumentationFile>
    <RemoveIntegerChecks>true</RemoveIntegerChecks>
    <DebugSymbols>true</DebugSymbols>
    <DebugType>full</DebugType>
    <DefineConstants>netcore5=1</DefineConstants>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>false</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
